{
  "_comment": "Chain detection for representative cover images. ORDER MATTERS: most specific first. 'pattern' is a case-insensitive JS regex source (compiled with the 'i' flag in lib/cafe-image.ts). To add a NEW chain, append an entry here AND add a matching image to data/category-images.json under the same key (see CLAUDE.md > Cafe images). Data-only: no code change needed.",
